{%- comment -%}
Collection pages, ported from the live category templates (crawled
2026-08-31). Primal handles (forequarter/loin/plate/round/offal) render the
sub-primal-grouped layout of the live /<primal> pages; /collections/all
renders the primal-grouped layout of /all-japanese-wagyu. Group headings and
descriptions come from the frozen CMS snapshot (audit/cms.json) and the
crawled pages. Everything else falls back to a plain grid.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% render 'hyun-nav' %}

{%- if collection.handle == 'forequarter' -%}
  {% render 'hyun-cuts-tabs', current: 1 %}
  <section id="Forequarter" class="section-49">
    <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer main-container w-container">
    {% render 'hyun-cut-group', anchor: 'fore-brisket', title: 'Brisket', handle: 'brisket', wrap_class: 'columns-33', item_class: 'collection-item-4 w-dyn-item w-col w-col-4', description: 'Brisket, with its strong umami from the abundant marbling and thick layer of fat, boasts a rich juiciness and exceptionally savory fat flavor. It offers a unique texture - tender yet satisfyingly chewy.' %}
    {% render 'hyun-cut-group', anchor: 'fore-chuckroll', title: 'Chuck Roll', handle: 'chuck-roll', wrap_class: 'columns-33', item_class: 'collection-item-4 w-dyn-item w-col w-col-4', description: 'Chuck roll is renowned for its high protein content, rich juiciness, and robust beefy aroma. Its distinct flavor intensifies with each chew, delivering a savory and satisfying taste.' %}
    {% render 'hyun-cut-group', anchor: 'fore-clod', title: 'Clod', handle: 'clod', wrap_class: 'columns-33', item_class: 'collection-item-4 w-dyn-item w-col w-col-4', description: 'Clod is characterized by lower fat content but abundant juiciness, providing a robust beefy aroma. Its excellent chewability makes it an ideal cut to savor the taste of beef protein.' %}
    {% render 'hyun-cut-group', anchor: 'fore-shank', title: 'Shank', handle: 'shank', wrap_class: 'columns-33', item_class: 'collection-item-4 w-dyn-item w-col w-col-4', description: 'Known for its high collagen and elastin content, Shank presents a dense concentration of beefy aroma and a subtly rich flavor. Its characteristic chewiness enhances the overall dining experience.' %}
    </div>
  </section>
{%- elsif collection.handle == 'loin' -%}
  {% render 'hyun-cuts-tabs', current: 2 %}
  <section id="Loin" class="section-49">
    <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer main-container w-container">
    {% render 'hyun-cut-group', anchor: 'loin-ribloin', title: 'Ribloin', handle: 'ribloin', wrap_class: 'columns-33', item_class: 'collection-item-4 w-dyn-item w-col w-col-4', description: 'Ribloin features finely marbled, tender meat with a deep beefy juiciness and the delightful flavor of marbling. It stands out among Wagyu cuts for its rich and savory taste.' %}
    {% render 'hyun-cut-group', anchor: 'loin-striploin', title: 'Striploin', handle: 'striploin', wrap_class: 'columns-33', item_class: 'collection-item-4 w-dyn-item w-col w-col-4', description: 'Striploin offers a delightful combination of tender beef protein and the savory aroma of intramuscular fat. Comprising a single muscle, it boasts a fine and tender texture.' %}
    {% render 'hyun-cut-group', anchor: 'loin-tenderloin', title: 'Tenderloin', handle: 'tenderloin', wrap_class: 'columns-33', item_class: 'collection-item-4 w-dyn-item w-col w-col-4', description: 'Tenderloin, the most tender cut, is distinguished by its velvety texture and minimal connective tissue. Obtained in small quantities from a single Japanese Wagyu, it epitomizes tenderness.' %}
    </div>
  </section>
{%- elsif collection.handle == 'plate' -%}
  {% render 'hyun-cuts-tabs', current: 3 %}
  <section id="Plate" class="section-49">
    <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer main-container w-container">
    {% render 'hyun-cut-group', anchor: 'shortplate', title: 'Short Plate', handle: 'short-plate', wrap_class: 'columns-33', item_class: 'collection-item-4 w-dyn-item w-col w-col-4', description: 'Short Plate, characterized by alternating layers of fat and muscle, showcases a coarse but marbled texture. The intramuscular fat acts as marbling, resulting in unparalleled juiciness among beef cuts.' %}
    {% render 'hyun-cut-group', anchor: 'shortrib', title: 'Short Rib', handle: 'short-rib', wrap_class: 'columns-33', item_class: 'collection-item-4 w-dyn-item w-col w-col-4', description: 'Short Rib, renowned for its rich juiciness and intense beefy aroma, complements marbling for a superbly flavorful experience. Its tenderness and chewy texture make it a favorite, especially in skirt steak cuts.' %}
    </div>
  </section>
{%- elsif collection.handle == 'round' -%}
  {% render 'hyun-cuts-tabs', current: 4 %}
  <section id="Round" class="section-49">
    <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer main-container w-container">
    {% render 'hyun-cut-group', anchor: 'round-gooseneck', title: 'Gooseneck Round', handle: 'gooseneck-round', wrap_class: 'columns-33', item_class: 'collection-item-4 w-dyn-item w-col w-col-4', description: 'Gooseneck round, nearly devoid of fat, boasts intense juiciness and a robust flavor profile. Its lean composition contributes to an excellent chewy texture.' %}
    {% render 'hyun-cut-group', anchor: 'round-knuckle', title: 'Knuckle', handle: 'knuckle', wrap_class: 'columns-33', item_class: 'collection-item-4 w-dyn-item w-col w-col-4', description: 'Knuckle, featuring the highest protein content and a beefy aroma, boasts thin and tender muscle fibers. Its fine texture and tenderness make it a delightful choice for those seeking a flavorful Wagyu beef experience.' %}
    {% render 'hyun-cut-group', anchor: 'round-rump', title: 'Rump', handle: 'rump', wrap_class: 'columns-33', item_class: 'collection-item-4 w-dyn-item w-col w-col-4', description: 'Rump, with its deep color and rich beefy aroma, exhibits a surprisingly tender and flavorful texture. Despite its robust appearance, the meat is tender and juicy.' %}
    {% render 'hyun-cut-group', anchor: 'round-topround', title: 'Top Round', handle: 'top-round', wrap_class: 'columns-33', item_class: 'collection-item-4 w-dyn-item w-col w-col-4', description: 'Top round, with low intramuscular fat and a high protein-to-fat ratio, offers a lean and subtly flavorful profile. Among hindquarter cuts, it stands out for its tenderness and clean taste.' %}
    </div>
  </section>
{%- elsif collection.handle == 'offal' -%}
  {% render 'hyun-cuts-tabs', current: 5 %}
  <section id="Offal" class="section-49">
    <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer main-container w-container">
    {% render 'hyun-cut-group', anchor: 'offal-group', title: 'Offal', handle: 'offal', wrap_class: 'columns-33', item_class: 'collection-item-4 w-dyn-item w-col w-col-4', description: 'Delve into bovine treasures - tongues, stomachs, intestines, and tails. Explore the offal kingdom, from Mountain Chain Tripe, Honey Comb Tripe, Omasum, and Abomasum, each revealing a unique gastronomic tale.' %}
    </div>
  </section>
{%- elsif collection.handle == 'all' -%}
  {% render 'hyun-cuts-tabs', current: 0 %}
  <section id="Forequarter" class="section-49">
    <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer main-container w-container">
    {% render 'hyun-cut-group', anchor: 'forequarter_section', title: 'Forequarter', handle: 'forequarter', wrap_class: 'columns-32', item_class: 'collection-item-3 w-dyn-item w-col w-col-4', description: 'In the beef realm, savor four distinguished cuts: Brisket, Chuck Roll, Clod, and Shank. Witness the marbled masterpiece of sirloin, where pink hues and white blossoms adorn the surface.' %}
    {% render 'hyun-cut-group', anchor: 'loin_Section', title: 'Loin', handle: 'loin', wrap_class: 'columns-32', item_class: 'collection-item-3 w-dyn-item w-col w-col-4', description: 'Experience beef perfection in three acts: Ribloin&#x27;s savory symphony, the tender marvel of Tenderloin, and the pinnacle of gastronomic excellence.' %}
    {% render 'hyun-cut-group', anchor: 'plate-section', title: 'Plate', handle: 'plate', wrap_class: 'columns-32', item_class: 'collection-item-3 w-dyn-item w-col w-col-4', description: 'Ascend to beef royalty with Short Rib reigning above, and the primal essence of Outside Skirt and Hanging Tender below, delivering unparalleled taste.' %}
    {% render 'hyun-cut-group', anchor: 'round-section', title: 'Round', handle: 'round', wrap_class: 'columns-32', item_class: 'collection-item-3 w-dyn-item w-col w-col-4', description: 'Journey to the rounded haven of Gooseneck Round, Top Round, Rump, and Knuckle. Discover lean elegance, with occasional marbled treasures like tenderloin head.' %}
    {% render 'hyun-cut-group', anchor: 'offal-section', title: 'Offal', handle: 'offal', wrap_class: 'columns-32', item_class: 'collection-item-3 w-dyn-item w-col w-col-4', description: 'Delve into bovine treasures—tongues, stomachs, intestines, and tails. Explore the offal kingdom, from Mountain Chain Tripe, Honey Comb Tripe, Omasum, and Abomasum, each revealing a unique gastronomic tale.' %}
    </div>
  </section>
{%- elsif collection.handle == 'bundles' -%}
  <section class="section-21">
    <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer main-container w-container">
      <div class="title-upper-text">																		Explore THE HYUN&#8217;s curated Japanese Wagyu symphony														</div>
      <h1 class="heading-12">Bundles</h1>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section>
    <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer main-container w-container">
      <div class="columns-6 w-row">
        <div class="column-15 w-col w-col-4">
          <div class="text-block-16">																		Expert suggestions can redefine our standards														</div>
        </div>
        <div class="column-69 w-col w-col-4">
          <div class="w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item">
            {%- assign b = all_products['the-hyuns-special-cuts'] -%}
            <a href="{{ b.url }}" class="bundlecardlink w-inline-block"><img loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 96vw, (max-width: 991px) 229px, 300px" alt="" src="{{ b.featured_image | image_url: width: 569 }}" width="569"/><div class="text-block-17">{{ b.title }}</div></a>
          </div></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="column-70 w-col w-col-4">
          <div class="w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item">
            {%- assign b = all_products['prime-bbq-collection'] -%}
            <a href="{{ b.url }}" class="bundlecardlink w-inline-block"><img loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 96vw, (max-width: 991px) 229px, 300px" alt="" src="{{ b.featured_image | image_url: width: 569 }}" width="569"/><div class="text-block-17">{{ b.title }}</div></a>
          </div></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="columns-6 w-row">
        <div class="column-71 w-col w-col-4">
          <div class="w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item">
            {%- assign b = all_products['babys-first-bites'] -%}
            <a href="{{ b.url }}" class="bundlecardlink w-inline-block"><img loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 96vw, (max-width: 991px) 229px, 300px" alt="" src="{{ b.featured_image | image_url: width: 569 }}" width="569"/><div class="text-block-17">{{ b.title }}</div></a>
          </div></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="column-72 w-col w-col-4">
          <div class="w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item">
            {%- assign b = all_products['innards-selection'] -%}
            <a href="{{ b.url }}" class="bundlecardlink blkbg w-inline-block"><img loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 96vw, (max-width: 991px) 229px, 300px" alt="" src="{{ b.featured_image | image_url: width: 569 }}" width="569"/><div class="text-block-17">{{ b.title }}</div></a>
          </div></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="column-12 w-col w-col-4">
          <div class="text-block-16">																		In Korean tradition, there&#x27;s a saying: &quot;He who has tasted meat knows what&#x27;s good.&quot; Why not lean in to listen to the curation of those who&#x27;ve passionately explored, researched, and pondered? Our thoughtfully selected choices, guided by experienced enthusiasts, hold the power to elevate your expectations, offering a taste that transcends the ordinary.														</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
{%- elsif collection.handle == 'gift-sets' -%}
  {% render 'hyun-gift-sets' %}
{%- else -%}
  <section class="section-35">
    <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-17 w-container">
      <h1 class="heading-12">{{ collection.title }}</h1>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section style="padding: 0 5% 10vh;">
    <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer main-container w-container">
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:24px;">
        {%- for product in collection.products -%}
          <a href="{{ product.url }}" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit;">
            {%- if product.featured_image -%}
              <img src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 440 }}" alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | escape }}" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover;margin-bottom:10px;"/>
            {%- endif -%}
            <div class="body-copy">{{ product.title }}</div>
            <div class="body-copy">{{ product.price_min | money }}{% if product.price_varies %}+{% endif %}</div>
          </a>
        {%- else -%}
          <div class="body-copy">No products in this collection yet.</div>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
{%- endif -%}
{% render 'hyun-footer' %}
